# Ada's Round (CIPlay adas_round; in the plan after The Franking Works): quest "Ada's Round"
island Ada's Round
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Ada's Round
expect hidden pigeonbox
expect hidden attic
expect hidden adanote
zone garden_gate
expect step 1
read Ada's diary
expect step 2
use atticdoor
expect message padlocked
use dovecote
expect story pigeonsflown 1
expect shown pigeonbox
expect step 3
open Pigeon box
wait 3
expect story attickey 1
expect step 4
use atticdoor
expect hidden atticdoor
expect shown attic
expect shown adanote
open Attic
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_TitaniumTools 1
expect item Blueprint_BackpackAdvanced 1
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineToolElectric 1
expect step 8
read Ada's note to the next postman
expect done
